WEBVTT

00:07.616 --> 00:09.376
[If you don't turn yourself in,
your limbs will rot and you'll die]

00:37.833 --> 00:40.813
[All characters and events are fictional,
and any resemblance is coincidental]

00:40.813 --> 00:43.133
[Scenes with children and animals were filmed
safely under professional supervision]

00:43.133 --> 00:44.800
[Central Veterans Hall]

00:44.800 --> 00:48.567
This recent redevelopment and reconstruction
reform bill has drawn strong reactions.

00:48.567 --> 00:52.467
There are many saying that
it's finally a bill that reflects reality.

00:52.467 --> 00:56.600
Association officials are also welcoming it,
saying negotiations have become much easier.

00:56.600 --> 00:59.133
How frustrated must they have been?

00:59.133 --> 01:01.333
The times are changing fast,

01:01.333 --> 01:03.733
but the law couldn't keep up with them.

01:03.733 --> 01:05.133
Even after the policy took effect,

01:05.133 --> 01:08.300
your approval ratings have stayed strong.

01:08.300 --> 01:11.500
At this rate, you might even want to start
thinking about a future presidential run.

01:11.500 --> 01:15.136
No, right now it's more about
public sentiment than the presidency.

01:15.936 --> 01:20.167
Is the interview we did
last time airing today?

01:20.167 --> 01:23.533
Yes, it'll be on air in 10 minutes.

01:23.533 --> 01:25.633
Let's watch it.

01:25.633 --> 01:28.608
The prime suspect
in the Kangseng Serial Murder Case

01:28.608 --> 01:30.600
which once plunged
the entire nation into fear,

01:30.600 --> 01:34.300
[Serial Murder Case: Suspect Identified]
has been identified 33 years after the crime.

01:34.300 --> 01:35.933
Wait.

01:35.933 --> 01:37.700
Switch back to that channel.

01:37.700 --> 01:39.833
Sure.

01:39.833 --> 01:42.000
Police said at a briefing this morning that,

01:42.000 --> 01:44.867
following a re-examination
by the National Forensic Service,

01:44.867 --> 01:48.233
they are investigating
after being informed that

01:48.233 --> 01:50.900
[Prime suspect: male inmate in his 60s]
an inmate's DNA matches evidence

01:50.900 --> 01:52.867
from three crime scenes.

01:52.867 --> 01:57.467
The suspect is a man in his 60s,
Mr. Lee, currently incarcerated...

02:08.100 --> 02:10.842
[Episode 5]

02:18.600 --> 02:21.867
Sun Young, can you hear me?

02:21.867 --> 02:23.000
Ji Won.

02:23.000 --> 02:24.633
Yeah.

02:27.767 --> 02:29.833
Why am I here?

02:30.933 --> 02:32.467
Don't you remember?

02:32.467 --> 02:35.467
What happened to you?

02:35.467 --> 02:37.100
Well...

02:49.167 --> 02:51.233
Someone was chasing me.

02:52.133 --> 02:54.433
I tried to run away from that person...

02:54.433 --> 02:56.233
Who was it?

02:57.567 --> 02:59.167
I don't know.

03:02.967 --> 03:04.000
Ki Beom...

03:04.000 --> 03:06.200
What happened to Ki Beom?

03:06.200 --> 03:08.100
We don't know yet.

03:10.100 --> 03:11.967
Sun Young, where are you going?

03:11.967 --> 03:14.133
I've got to find Ki Beom!

03:20.900 --> 03:23.967
Sun Young, you...

03:34.333 --> 03:36.233
Is this that punk?

03:36.233 --> 03:37.467
I found the owner of the handkerchief.

03:37.467 --> 03:38.933
This is Sun Young's handkerchief?

03:38.933 --> 03:40.967
Sun Young made this herself.

03:40.967 --> 03:44.000
The only person who could have
something identical to this is Ki Beom.

03:44.000 --> 03:46.300
So he only covered his face in front of me?

03:46.300 --> 03:47.900
Why?

04:07.712 --> 04:08.800
[Restricted Area]

04:08.800 --> 04:10.400
Sir!

04:11.600 --> 04:12.800
What happened?

04:12.800 --> 04:14.400
Well...

04:14.400 --> 04:15.936
We lost him.

04:17.504 --> 04:18.688
[Surgery in progress]

04:21.114 --> 04:22.333
Doctor,

04:22.333 --> 04:24.300
how is he?

04:24.300 --> 04:26.233
The surgery went well.

04:26.233 --> 04:29.500
Fortunately, there is no organ damage,
so he is in stable condition.

04:29.500 --> 04:33.533
Infection is the main concern,
but we'll monitor him for now.

04:35.067 --> 04:38.133
These are the patient's belongings.

04:41.733 --> 04:45.967
Prosecutor Cha went there to deliver this...

04:49.667 --> 04:53.067
[Police Officer ID: Kang Tae Joo]

04:59.267 --> 05:01.033
Did you not know you were pregnant?

05:01.033 --> 05:02.733
It seems like it's been about three months.

05:02.733 --> 05:06.533
- Pregnant?
- Oh dear, you didn't know.

05:07.367 --> 05:09.800
And the baby? Is the baby okay?

05:09.800 --> 05:12.667
Yes, there's nothing to worry about.

05:12.667 --> 05:16.000
Fortunately, there are
no signs of concussion.

05:16.000 --> 05:20.167
As long as the scrapes on your legs
are treated well, you should be fine.

05:20.167 --> 05:24.833
If you feel dizzy or develop headaches later,
make sure to get checked.

05:25.567 --> 05:27.400
- Okay.
- Thank you.

05:30.800 --> 05:32.733
Oh, Sun Young...

05:32.733 --> 05:35.767
Oh, Sun Young, Sun Young.

05:37.800 --> 05:40.533
Don't tell my brother, please.
I'll tell him myself later.

05:40.533 --> 05:42.133
Alright, alright.

05:43.900 --> 05:44.900
Kang Sun Young.

05:44.900 --> 05:46.967
Who is it? That punk?

05:46.967 --> 05:48.200
Tae Joo.

05:48.200 --> 05:50.133
Who's the culprit? I'm asking!

05:50.133 --> 05:51.833
You, hey!

05:53.367 --> 05:55.167
What are you doing
with someone who just woke up?

05:55.167 --> 05:56.667
Answer me!

05:56.667 --> 05:58.700
I don't know. I didn't see him.

05:58.700 --> 05:59.800
Are you sure?

05:59.800 --> 06:02.167
Why would I lie?

06:04.300 --> 06:06.433
You were with Ki Beom.

06:06.433 --> 06:09.133
Why are you bringing Ki Beom up?

06:09.133 --> 06:11.433
Are you seriously suspecting him?

06:15.200 --> 06:16.433
Are you out of your mind?

06:16.433 --> 06:18.033
Then what about all this?

06:18.033 --> 06:21.200
Where did Ki Beom go?
Why did this happen to you?

06:21.200 --> 06:24.867
I'll explain. Stop pushing me.

06:27.933 --> 06:31.767
So Ki Beom locked you
in a warehouse and left on his own?

06:33.000 --> 06:35.733
He said he would handle everything himself.

06:36.367 --> 06:38.100
I went after Ki Beom a bit late,

06:38.100 --> 06:40.833
and someone started following me,
so at first I thought it was the police.

06:40.833 --> 06:44.633
I thought they were tailing me to catch
Ki Beom, so I tried to shake them off.

06:44.633 --> 06:47.167
Then I fell into the ditch.

06:47.867 --> 06:49.333
That's all.

06:49.333 --> 06:51.867
I don't remember anything after that.

06:52.967 --> 06:54.567
Kang Sun Young.

06:55.200 --> 06:57.933
If you're lying just to protect Ki Beom...

06:57.933 --> 06:59.967
It's all true, Tae Joo.

07:01.267 --> 07:02.867
Are you sure?

07:07.867 --> 07:09.967
What happened to Ki Beom?

07:10.867 --> 07:12.800
We're still chasing him.

07:12.800 --> 07:14.200
Ki Beom was going to turn himself in.

07:14.200 --> 07:15.400
I stopped him.

07:15.400 --> 07:16.933
What?

07:16.933 --> 07:18.333
Hey, what were you thinking...

07:18.333 --> 07:19.667
You should've told me.

07:19.667 --> 07:21.200
I was going to.

07:21.200 --> 07:23.200
But when I went to the police station,
you weren't there.

07:23.200 --> 07:24.933
And they said Jeon Kyeong Ho might die.

07:24.933 --> 07:26.433
- What am I supposed to do, then?
- Die? He won't die.

07:26.433 --> 07:28.100
That punk woke up.

07:28.100 --> 07:30.067
No need to worry.

07:31.367 --> 07:33.233
Oh, thank goodness.

07:35.533 --> 07:38.133
But he's not the problem right now.

07:38.133 --> 07:40.100
Then what is the problem?

07:49.850 --> 07:58.618
[Kangseng Jaeil Hospital]

08:08.467 --> 08:11.744
Don't worry about Sun Young.
I'll stay by her side.

08:13.200 --> 08:14.867
I'm counting on you.

08:16.667 --> 08:18.767
Isn't it strange?

08:18.767 --> 08:23.633
If Ki Beom were the culprit, he wouldn't
have locked Sun Young in the warehouse.

08:26.867 --> 08:28.067
Tae Joo.

08:28.067 --> 08:29.067
The Ki Beom we knew...

08:29.067 --> 08:30.667
Ji Won.

08:31.300 --> 08:34.100
I'm going to erase the Ki Beom I knew.

08:34.100 --> 08:36.300
That's better for him too.

08:38.000 --> 08:40.500
Whether he's the culprit or not...

09:07.767 --> 09:10.800
[Kangseng Jaeil Hospital
Nighttime Emergency Room]

09:17.133 --> 09:18.700
You know it, right?

09:18.700 --> 09:20.867
The reason why Ki Beom is on the run...

09:29.833 --> 09:33.733
Tell me, what exactly is going on?

09:39.633 --> 09:41.433
Ki Beom is...

09:43.200 --> 09:46.200
a suspect in the serial murder case.

09:47.633 --> 09:49.267
What?

10:02.567 --> 10:08.500
I thought you were my father's son.

10:08.500 --> 10:11.200
But I can't stand brothers.

10:11.200 --> 10:13.200
Friends are fine, though.

10:24.867 --> 10:28.533
Si Young!

10:28.533 --> 10:30.700
What on earth is going on?

10:30.700 --> 10:32.300
Si Young!

10:36.100 --> 10:37.700
It was you, wasn't it?

10:38.800 --> 10:40.733
You did this, right?

10:40.733 --> 10:43.233
You punk, you really did this to Si Young!

10:47.533 --> 10:49.600
If I hadn't been drinking...

10:49.600 --> 10:52.467
Call Cha Si Young's house, you punk.

10:53.133 --> 10:55.467
There's no one at his house.

10:59.367 --> 11:01.267
What do you mean no one?

11:03.333 --> 11:07.200
Si Young lives alone in that big house.

11:10.500 --> 11:11.600
What about his family?

11:11.600 --> 11:15.867
His parents and older brother
are probably in Seoul.

11:15.867 --> 11:19.100
Are you interrogating me right now?

11:22.933 --> 11:25.700
Call me when this punk wakes up.

11:27.000 --> 11:29.100
That punk...

11:40.433 --> 11:42.700
Does he not have a home phone number?

11:45.633 --> 11:49.667
[Cha Jun Young]

11:51.867 --> 11:56.200
Why would a superintendent
step in over a sergeant's resignation?

11:56.200 --> 11:57.200
A superintendent?

11:57.200 --> 11:59.100
You don't know Superintendent Cha Jun Young?

11:59.100 --> 12:02.233
The youngest ever
to become a superintendent in Korea.

12:03.233 --> 12:07.033
Cha Jun Young, Cha Si Young...

12:07.994 --> 12:13.722
[Payphone Booth]

12:23.200 --> 12:24.367
Hello?

12:24.367 --> 12:27.267
Hello, is this Superintendent Cha Jun Young?

12:27.267 --> 12:28.700
Speaking.

12:28.700 --> 12:31.900
This is Sergeant Kang Tae Joo
from Kangseng Station.

12:31.900 --> 12:33.300
Sergeant?

12:33.300 --> 12:36.533
Why would a sergeant call me?

12:36.533 --> 12:38.767
And at this hour?

12:38.767 --> 12:41.000
I'm calling about Prosecutor Cha Si Young.

12:41.000 --> 12:44.467
Prosecutor Cha Si Young
is currently in the hospital.

12:44.467 --> 12:45.833
Why is he in the hospital?

12:45.833 --> 12:49.400
He was stabbed during the arrest
of a serial killer suspect.

12:49.400 --> 12:50.656
Jeez...

12:54.033 --> 12:56.533
Wait, did he catch the suspect then?

12:56.533 --> 12:57.533
No.

12:57.533 --> 12:59.200
Are you sure that's the culprit?

12:59.200 --> 13:03.300
It's too early to say for certain.

13:04.467 --> 13:06.167
Yeah?

13:06.800 --> 13:09.867
The surgery went well.
I thought you might want to know.

13:09.867 --> 13:11.600
I'll hang up now.

13:11.600 --> 13:14.000
Wait, how did you know I'm his brother?

13:14.000 --> 13:16.700
Did he go around bragging about it?

13:16.700 --> 13:18.500
I figured it out from the contacts.

13:18.500 --> 13:19.800
Figured it out?

13:19.800 --> 13:24.467
Cha Jun Young, Cha Si Young...
they're obviously sibling names.

13:24.467 --> 13:26.467
Okay, then I'll hang up now.

13:29.733 --> 13:32.867
What's with this guy?
He's only asking about the suspect...

13:32.867 --> 13:35.367
His own brother got stabbed.

13:36.433 --> 13:40.167
So he lost the suspect?

13:49.433 --> 13:52.333
Hey, Kang Shik, it's Ki Hwan.

13:52.333 --> 13:54.767
Do you know where Ki Beom is?

13:55.467 --> 13:57.100
You don't know?

13:57.833 --> 14:00.467
If you somehow get in touch
with Ki Beom or anything,

14:00.467 --> 14:03.533
could you please tell him to contact me?

14:03.533 --> 14:04.933
- Well, no, I mean...
- Oh, dear.

14:04.933 --> 14:07.067
Alright, I'm hanging up.

14:08.333 --> 14:11.267
Who is calling so early? Is it Ki Beom?

14:11.267 --> 14:12.800
Oh, Ki Beom... yes, it's Ki Beom.

14:12.800 --> 14:15.767
He just called to say he arrived safely
at his friend's house.

14:15.767 --> 14:16.833
Oh, dear.

14:16.833 --> 14:18.933
Did Ki Beom go somewhere?

14:21.100 --> 14:22.700
Where was it again?

14:22.700 --> 14:24.600
Did he say Haenam?

14:24.600 --> 14:28.000
He once went to help out with farm work
at a friend's place there.

14:28.000 --> 14:30.500
Tae Joo, what brings you here so early?

14:30.500 --> 14:33.533
I was grocery shopping
and ran into him nearby.

14:33.533 --> 14:34.533
Thank you.

14:34.533 --> 14:36.167
Thanks to you, Tae Joo,
we got home without any trouble.

14:36.167 --> 14:38.100
Don't mention it.
I don't get to visit often anyway.

14:38.100 --> 14:41.133
- Ma'am, everything okay?
- Hey,

14:41.133 --> 14:42.600
something good happened to you?

14:42.600 --> 14:43.700
What good would there be?

14:43.700 --> 14:45.733
Hey, did something good happen?

14:52.233 --> 14:54.533
Did Ki Beom get caught?
Is that why you are here?

14:54.533 --> 14:57.000
No, it's nothing like that.

14:59.467 --> 15:02.600
Don't you dare mention Ki Beom to my mother.

15:02.600 --> 15:05.300
I just said he went to visit a friend
in the countryside.

15:05.300 --> 15:07.533
So you don't know where Ki Beom is, either?

15:07.533 --> 15:09.667
Don't know. That punk...

15:09.667 --> 15:12.233
I haven't heard from him
since that incident yesterday.

15:13.700 --> 15:15.533
Is that guy okay?

15:15.533 --> 15:16.900
Jeon Kyeong Ho?

15:16.900 --> 15:18.833
Don't worry about that punk.

15:18.833 --> 15:20.167
It'll be settled with an agreement.

15:20.167 --> 15:21.900
What? Are you sure?

15:21.900 --> 15:24.333
He's done plenty of wrong himself too.

15:24.333 --> 15:27.933
Anyway, we need Ki Beom
for the settlement paperwork.

15:27.933 --> 15:29.100
If you find him, send him to me immediately.

15:29.100 --> 15:32.933
Okay, oh... thank you so much, Tae Joo.

15:32.933 --> 15:34.867
Thank you, really.

15:34.867 --> 15:36.767
- I'm leaving.
- Alright.

15:36.767 --> 15:39.258
- Take care on your way.
- Yeah.

15:41.567 --> 15:42.767
[Period for Reporting and Surrendering Spies]
He's not home?

15:42.767 --> 15:45.467
Then, is there anywhere else he might go?

15:45.467 --> 15:48.133
Even his family didn't seem to know
Ki Beom's whereabouts.

15:48.133 --> 15:51.733
How do you know they weren't just pretending?

15:51.733 --> 15:55.067
His family thinks Ki Beom
is running from assault charges.

15:55.067 --> 15:58.067
His mother doesn't even
seem to know that much.

16:00.200 --> 16:02.667
Since news of Jeon Kyeong Ho
dropping the charges was leaked,

16:02.667 --> 16:05.933
if Ki Beom isn't the serial killer,

16:05.933 --> 16:07.633
he'll respond to that.

16:07.633 --> 16:11.400
So are you saying Ki Beom
might not be the culprit?

16:11.400 --> 16:13.167
What nonsense are you talking about now?

16:13.167 --> 16:14.600
If it's not Ki Beom, then who is it?

16:14.600 --> 16:18.800
At the place they went to find Ki Beom,
Detective Kang's sister almost got hurt.

16:18.800 --> 16:20.967
And the prosecutor was stabbed.

16:20.967 --> 16:22.300
It can't be anyone else.

16:22.300 --> 16:24.367
Right now, it's still
just circumstantial evidence.

16:24.367 --> 16:26.733
The circumstantial evidence is piling up!

16:29.033 --> 16:32.400
Sir, we should put Lee Ki Beom
on the wanted list now,

16:32.400 --> 16:34.700
and search his house and the bookstore.

16:35.367 --> 16:38.533
Prosecutor Cha Si Young
might have seen the suspect.

16:38.533 --> 16:42.200
What if the person Prosecutor Cha saw
wasn't Lee Ki Beom?

16:42.200 --> 16:44.433
I'm telling you, there's no way that's true.

16:44.433 --> 16:48.000
Let's just wait until
Prosecutor Cha wakes up, okay?

16:48.000 --> 16:49.367
- Sir.
- Sir.

16:49.367 --> 16:50.500
Prosecutor Cha will wake up soon.

16:50.500 --> 16:52.700
Right now, every second matters.

16:52.700 --> 16:53.767
Right, sir.

16:53.767 --> 16:55.867
We really don't have time.

16:55.867 --> 16:57.567
- Sir.
- Darn it, you're too loud.

16:57.567 --> 17:00.033
Just be quiet for a second, and let me think.

17:00.033 --> 17:02.233
Okay? We don't have time, sir!

17:02.233 --> 17:03.900
Oh, jeez!

17:06.800 --> 17:08.900
Yes, this is Kangseng Police Station.

17:09.933 --> 17:11.488
What?

17:11.488 --> 17:13.367
A murder case?

17:18.600 --> 17:21.533
Joo Hee, wake up!

17:22.300 --> 17:24.800
Time to eat.

17:25.767 --> 17:28.533
Why are you suddenly sleeping in?

17:28.533 --> 17:32.400
Get up and eat. You have to go to school.

17:38.700 --> 17:40.767
Her mother found her in the morning.

17:40.767 --> 17:42.800
There are signs of strangulation.

17:42.800 --> 17:46.300
Gosh. She's way too young.

17:55.867 --> 17:57.440
The pattern is different.

17:57.440 --> 17:58.933
[No entry, under investigation]
Was the front gate open?

17:58.933 --> 18:00.867
They said it was open
when they checked it this morning.

18:00.867 --> 18:02.433
Was she alone yesterday?

18:02.433 --> 18:05.467
No. Her parents were sleeping
in the next room.

18:05.467 --> 18:08.200
Wow, that guy is a total scumbag.

18:08.200 --> 18:11.267
Her parents were right there,
but still he did that to the girl...

18:11.267 --> 18:12.672
Under one roof...

18:12.672 --> 18:15.616
He's completely out of his mind.

18:18.617 --> 18:20.000
My gosh.

18:20.000 --> 18:22.010
- What is it?
- Move.

18:26.567 --> 18:27.867
What happened?

18:27.867 --> 18:29.200
They say a child got killed.

18:29.200 --> 18:30.367
- What happened?
- Is it true?

18:30.367 --> 18:31.767
- A middle schooler was found dead at home.
- Why?

18:31.767 --> 18:33.967
Don't tell me it's a serial case?

18:38.333 --> 18:40.467
What?

18:40.467 --> 18:42.933
Right? The place from yesterday?

18:55.433 --> 18:57.267
Got you!

18:58.100 --> 18:59.584
You little rat.

19:01.967 --> 19:03.433
Hey, Do Hyeong Gu!

19:03.433 --> 19:06.967
In 13 years on the job,
that was your best moment!

19:06.967 --> 19:08.733
- Did you see that?
- That was cool.

19:08.733 --> 19:11.633
- We caught him together, okay?
- I've got to pee. I'll be right back.

19:11.633 --> 19:12.667
Hurry up and come back.

19:12.667 --> 19:14.033
Ah, that punk...

19:14.033 --> 19:19.367
What is he, a puppy? He just goes around
marking his territory everywhere.

19:20.367 --> 19:24.467
Go farther away to piss, you punk.

19:24.467 --> 19:26.300
Hey, where are you going?

19:26.300 --> 19:27.700
Hey! Get him!

19:27.700 --> 19:29.818
Hey, cut it out, you punk!

19:29.818 --> 19:31.635
That punk!

19:35.567 --> 19:37.433
Darn it, you punk!

19:37.433 --> 19:41.533
If this was Lee Ki Beom's doing, shouldn't we
say something now? About yesterday.

19:41.533 --> 19:44.233
Jeez, this is driving me crazy.

19:44.233 --> 19:46.778
How does this even make sense?

19:50.667 --> 19:52.224
Hey!

19:52.224 --> 19:53.533
Oh my.

19:53.533 --> 19:56.167
Hey!

19:56.167 --> 19:58.000
What is all this nonsense?

19:58.000 --> 20:00.033
Why did our Joo Hee die?

20:00.033 --> 20:03.900
I didn't hear a thing while I was sleeping.

20:03.900 --> 20:06.367
I'm her father,

20:06.367 --> 20:11.233
but I didn't even notice
my own child dying right next to me.

20:11.233 --> 20:16.167
I was... I was sleeping just next door!

20:16.167 --> 20:18.800
Gosh... what kind of father am I?

20:18.800 --> 20:21.033
Wait...

20:21.033 --> 20:23.367
What are we going to do about poor Joo Hee?

20:23.367 --> 20:25.600
How can this happen to her?

20:25.600 --> 20:27.500
It's all my fault!

20:27.500 --> 20:30.167
I killed her! I killed her!

20:30.167 --> 20:32.567
Why would it be your fault?

20:32.567 --> 20:36.033
It's the darn cops' fault
for not catching a single murderer.

20:36.033 --> 20:37.100
That's right!

20:37.100 --> 20:38.333
How many times has this happened now?

20:38.333 --> 20:39.600
Is this even a place where people can live?

20:39.600 --> 20:43.700
We can be careful outside at night,
but what if we're killed in our own beds?

20:43.700 --> 20:44.833
Exactly.

20:44.833 --> 20:47.933
People are getting murdered day after day.

20:47.933 --> 20:50.500
How can anyone live like this?

20:50.500 --> 20:52.133
Exactly!

20:53.338 --> 20:55.700
- Sir!
- Come on!

20:55.700 --> 20:57.533
Why are you doing this?

21:00.033 --> 21:02.200
Wait, hold on.

21:02.200 --> 21:03.867
- Wait, just a moment please.
- Sir.

21:03.867 --> 21:07.000
- Please calm down. It's okay, calm down.
- Sir...

21:07.000 --> 21:08.933
I'm the one in charge.

21:08.933 --> 21:12.300
The lack of progress
in the investigation so far...

21:12.300 --> 21:14.067
Yes, I have no excuse.

21:14.067 --> 21:16.467
As the chief, I bear
the greatest responsibility.

21:16.467 --> 21:18.600
But our detectives

21:18.600 --> 21:21.467
and officers are all doing their best

21:21.467 --> 21:24.067
day and night in their respective roles.

21:24.067 --> 21:27.767
So if you could just trust us

21:27.767 --> 21:30.833
a little longer and wait, we will...

21:30.833 --> 21:32.867
Wait for what?

21:32.867 --> 21:34.133
Let's just leave.

21:34.133 --> 21:35.467
Please stop this.

21:35.467 --> 21:36.567
We will...

21:36.567 --> 21:40.600
- We will definitely catch the culprit.
- When?

21:43.333 --> 21:44.933
- What are you doing?
- Do it properly.

22:22.567 --> 22:27.133
[Kangseng Police Station]

22:29.533 --> 22:31.233
- Hurry up!
- What is it?

22:31.233 --> 22:32.367
Jeez.

22:32.367 --> 22:34.533
What's with this mess?

22:34.533 --> 22:35.833
What's going on?

22:35.833 --> 22:37.533
The superintendent's coming. Line up quickly!

22:37.533 --> 22:39.533
The superintendent's here!

22:39.533 --> 22:41.200
Superintendent!

22:41.200 --> 22:43.433
Put this on first.

22:44.867 --> 22:47.233
Dae Ho, take that!

22:48.900 --> 22:50.100
Okay, he's coming.

22:50.100 --> 22:51.100
One moment, please.

22:51.100 --> 22:53.333
- The superintendent?
- Everyone, line up!

23:02.400 --> 23:04.100
Everyone, attention!

23:06.233 --> 23:07.867
Salute!

23:13.300 --> 23:15.200
Welcome, sir.

23:25.500 --> 23:26.633
Why is he here?

23:26.633 --> 23:27.667
I don't know, either.

23:27.667 --> 23:29.800
Should we go in too?

23:35.700 --> 23:40.833
Even His Excellency
made this decision with great difficulty.

23:40.833 --> 23:43.967
He acknowledges all your hard work.

23:44.800 --> 23:48.300
Don't take this assignment as a demotion.

23:48.300 --> 23:53.833
Think of it as a chance to rest.

23:59.633 --> 24:02.567
Oh, this tea isn't bad.

24:31.667 --> 24:33.367
Give me some water.

24:34.700 --> 24:37.433
Si Young, are you awake?

24:38.167 --> 24:39.267
I said water.

24:39.267 --> 24:40.567
Water, water...

24:40.567 --> 24:43.300
Excuse me! Doctor!

24:50.833 --> 24:52.767
The wound has healed well.

24:52.767 --> 24:55.567
But avoid getting it wet
when bathing for now.

24:55.567 --> 24:56.967
So can I be discharged?

24:56.967 --> 24:59.633
Let's decide after checking tomorrow.

24:59.633 --> 25:01.267
Alright, then...

25:04.933 --> 25:06.567
Thank you!

25:10.267 --> 25:12.500
You're incredibly lucky it wasn't worse.

25:12.500 --> 25:15.767
You wouldn't wake up for so long,
so I thought you were in serious trouble.

25:15.767 --> 25:17.367
What about the culprit?

25:18.200 --> 25:20.000
Not caught yet.

25:20.967 --> 25:24.933
More importantly, the whole Kangseng
went crazy while you were asleep.

25:25.767 --> 25:30.100
The National Police Agency holds Kangseng
Police accountable for the serial killings

25:30.100 --> 25:34.933
and demotes Park Eun Kyu
to the Jeolla Provincial Police Headquarters.

25:34.933 --> 25:38.433
Wow, they replaced the police chief
in the middle of this?

25:38.433 --> 25:40.900
Even three team leaders? What's happening?

25:40.900 --> 25:45.467
Superintendent Cha Jun Young,
the youngest in the country,

25:45.467 --> 25:48.667
has been appointed as the new chief
of Kangseng Police Station.

25:49.733 --> 25:51.700
[Cha Jun Young]
Public trust in law enforcement

25:51.700 --> 25:56.067
has hit rock bottom
due to the sluggish investigation so far.

25:56.067 --> 25:57.667
We plan to deploy

25:57.667 --> 26:02.600
large-scale manpower and set up
a new investigation task force.

26:02.600 --> 26:04.867
You said you'd expedite the investigation.

26:04.867 --> 26:08.633
When can we expect visible results?

26:08.633 --> 26:11.633
It's difficult to give a specific timeframe,

26:11.633 --> 26:15.533
but if we move away from a passive approach
and act more aggressively,

26:15.533 --> 26:20.167
I believe we can restore
our damaged reputation.

26:20.167 --> 26:23.700
Are you saying you're confident
you can restore trust

26:23.700 --> 26:26.267
from the victims and their families?

26:26.267 --> 26:27.267
On the honor of the police...

26:27.267 --> 26:31.467
Wow, looks like some big shot's here.

26:31.467 --> 26:34.133
He's just a cop though.

26:36.967 --> 26:39.648
Good work.

26:41.400 --> 26:43.900
Don't feel so down.

26:43.900 --> 26:48.800
This horrific case is happening in the place
where you were born and raised.

26:48.800 --> 26:53.867
You must catch him on the honor
of Kangseng Police, no matter what.

26:53.867 --> 26:55.567
Yes, sir.

26:59.933 --> 27:01.567
Sir.

27:05.433 --> 27:07.467
Drive safely.

27:08.833 --> 27:10.933
- I'm leaving.
- Okay.

27:12.333 --> 27:14.133
Everyone, attention!

27:14.133 --> 27:16.767
Salute to Mr. Kim!

27:16.767 --> 27:18.667
Thank you for your hard work!

27:25.033 --> 27:26.667
Let's head inside.

27:28.400 --> 27:31.033
Where on earth is that punk Kang Tae Joo?

27:31.033 --> 27:33.767
He doesn't even know what Mr. Kim
did for him. What an ungrateful punk.

27:33.767 --> 27:35.500
Where did he go?

27:52.400 --> 27:54.733
Hey, what are you doing here?

27:55.367 --> 27:57.133
Were you waiting for me?

27:58.100 --> 28:00.067
Why are you grinning like that?

28:00.067 --> 28:01.833
You like getting transferred that much?

28:01.833 --> 28:03.872
If I'm being demoted to the seaside,
how could I not be happy?

28:03.872 --> 28:06.733
You know how much I love sea fishing.

28:08.900 --> 28:10.733
Take this.

28:10.733 --> 28:12.333
What's this?

28:16.433 --> 28:20.100
This still reeks of eggs.
Why do you keep wearing it?

28:20.100 --> 28:22.467
It bothers me.

28:22.467 --> 28:25.312
- Does it smell?
- Obviously! You think it doesn't?

28:28.733 --> 28:30.867
Since when do you have money?

28:30.867 --> 28:32.833
Just...

28:32.833 --> 28:34.500
I made quite a bit.

28:37.767 --> 28:39.267
But isn't it a bit oversized?

28:39.267 --> 28:41.933
Come on, you should be wearing that size.

28:42.600 --> 28:44.500
That way it covers your belly too.

28:44.500 --> 28:46.800
You're not even that skinny anyway.

28:46.800 --> 28:49.167
I don't have a belly, you punk!

28:51.267 --> 28:52.867
Tae Joo,

28:53.633 --> 28:55.333
you're a good detective.

28:55.333 --> 28:57.200
However,

28:57.200 --> 29:01.267
don't try to handle everything alone.
Work with your colleagues.

29:01.267 --> 29:03.867
From my experience,

29:03.867 --> 29:06.200
your colleagues are your greatest asset.

29:09.667 --> 29:11.633
Remember that, you punk.

29:19.233 --> 29:21.433
Thanks. I'm off.

29:44.700 --> 29:47.067
Nagging till the very end.

29:48.667 --> 29:51.233
Take care, sir.

29:54.533 --> 29:56.167
Autopsy results show

29:57.767 --> 30:01.367
the victim was sexually assaulted
and then strangled to death.

30:02.367 --> 30:03.667
Any clues on the culprit?

30:03.667 --> 30:08.400
Yes, what appears to be the suspect's hair
and bodily fluids were found at the scene.

30:08.400 --> 30:12.267
Once again, the suspect is identified
as a male with blood type B.

30:12.267 --> 30:13.867
That's it?

30:14.500 --> 30:16.300
Yes.

30:16.300 --> 30:18.100
There's nothing new at all!

30:18.100 --> 30:20.900
This is why people in charge get fired.

30:20.900 --> 30:22.500
- Sorry, sir.
- Jeez.

30:23.333 --> 30:25.233
Kang Tae Joo!

30:25.233 --> 30:27.300
- Yes, sir.
- What do you think?

30:27.300 --> 30:29.433
Is this also a serial murder case?

30:32.833 --> 30:35.900
I don't think it's a serial murder.

30:35.900 --> 30:37.367
Why?

30:37.367 --> 30:42.400
Unlike previous cases, this one involved
a home invasion, not an open-area attack.

30:42.400 --> 30:44.233
The victim was 14,

30:44.233 --> 30:47.367
which is different
from the previous age range.

30:47.367 --> 30:51.100
There's also no sign of the serial killer's

30:51.100 --> 30:53.200
usual binding pattern.

30:53.200 --> 30:54.833
Is that so?

30:59.533 --> 31:01.500
Are you okay?

31:01.500 --> 31:03.533
What's wrong with him now?
Do you need to take a dump?

31:03.533 --> 31:05.067
Pardon?

31:05.067 --> 31:06.767
Or do you have something to say?

31:07.467 --> 31:09.967
No, I mean, it's just that...

31:09.967 --> 31:12.733
Around 11 PM on the night of the crime,

31:12.733 --> 31:16.633
suspect Lee Ki Beom was spotted
near victim Lee Joo Hee's residence.

31:16.633 --> 31:19.633
He was probably running away
after committing the crime.

31:19.633 --> 31:21.233
This case...

31:22.000 --> 31:24.133
is clearly a serial murder.

31:24.133 --> 31:25.767
Yes.

31:26.667 --> 31:28.267
That's all from me.

31:32.767 --> 31:35.667
These guys are unbelievable.

31:36.300 --> 31:37.933
Huh?

31:38.900 --> 31:41.033
You hid something that important?

31:41.033 --> 31:42.880
Have you lost your mind?

31:43.667 --> 31:46.533
Fine, I admit I messed up.

31:46.533 --> 31:48.067
But how could I have known?

31:48.067 --> 31:51.033
That he'd kill again while fleeing?

31:51.680 --> 31:53.054
Darn it!

31:54.528 --> 31:59.100
Around 11 PM, that's right after
the attack on Prosecutor Cha.

31:59.100 --> 32:00.667
Right.

32:00.667 --> 32:02.933
So he escaped the scene
and hid in Lee Joo Hee's house.

32:02.933 --> 32:05.600
The alibi checks out perfectly,
and the timeline fits as well.

32:05.600 --> 32:07.800
Kang Tae Joo!

32:07.800 --> 32:10.000
Even now, you still think
Lee Ki Beom isn't the real killer?

32:10.000 --> 32:11.633
Even with this?

32:18.833 --> 32:21.100
His Excellency sent me.

32:21.100 --> 32:23.200
It's also Father's will.

32:23.900 --> 32:25.800
Father did?

32:25.800 --> 32:30.100
Whether it's democratization or what,
the aftermath of last June's protests still...

32:30.100 --> 32:34.067
Now, it's even about to
influence the upcoming by-election.

32:34.067 --> 32:35.467
But you know

32:35.467 --> 32:39.633
how crucial this election is for Father.

32:42.200 --> 32:46.400
So Father wants us brothers to take the lead

32:46.400 --> 32:49.600
and solve this case together.

32:49.600 --> 32:50.633
"Us brothers"?

32:50.633 --> 32:52.600
Yes.

32:52.600 --> 32:56.367
Does that mean you're accepting me
as your brother?

32:56.367 --> 33:00.233
Hey, have we ever not been brothers? Huh?

33:00.233 --> 33:02.567
We share the same father's blood.

33:02.567 --> 33:05.167
Now I'm starting to feel hurt.

33:19.400 --> 33:22.467
Get up, get up!

33:23.808 --> 33:25.216
You little punk.

33:28.767 --> 33:31.567
He'll do better next time.

33:31.567 --> 33:36.000
You know how smart Si Young is.

33:36.000 --> 33:37.767
Right?

33:37.767 --> 33:39.400
Si Young...

33:42.500 --> 33:44.400
Father, I was wrong.

33:44.400 --> 33:46.133
Please, just one more chance.

33:46.867 --> 33:49.067
Give me just one more chance, please.

33:49.067 --> 33:50.667
Please, just once.

33:55.667 --> 34:00.633
To live as my son in this house,
you must prove worthy.

34:00.633 --> 34:02.433
Remember that.

34:07.533 --> 34:12.300
[Cha Si Young: 2nd Place]

34:18.433 --> 34:20.567
Don't take Father's words lightly.

34:20.567 --> 34:22.733
You'll be out otherwise.

34:25.833 --> 34:30.300
You don't think you're
the only illegitimate child, do you?

34:32.896 --> 34:34.528
Jeez.

34:40.200 --> 34:43.700
Anyway, take care of yourself.

34:43.700 --> 34:45.667
Let's do our best.

34:45.667 --> 34:47.533
I'm leaving.

34:47.533 --> 34:49.133
Take care.

34:58.500 --> 35:00.300
"Us brothers"?

35:03.367 --> 35:07.333
There was a time I desperately
wanted to hear that.

35:09.067 --> 35:11.433
But now?

35:11.433 --> 35:14.867
I'm already too old
to play the spoiled little brother with you.

35:31.767 --> 35:33.467
Sir!

35:39.100 --> 35:41.633
I heard a new task force is being formed.

35:41.633 --> 35:44.800
Has the new team leader been decided?

35:47.433 --> 35:50.367
Why would that interest you?

35:50.367 --> 35:52.567
What, trying to get yourself in line early?

35:52.567 --> 35:54.833
I have zero interest in that.

35:55.967 --> 36:00.833
Isn't that a position
meant to stand up for subordinates,

36:00.833 --> 36:03.067
even if it means taking the blame?

36:03.067 --> 36:07.533
Please use your influence
to bring in someone like that.

36:23.267 --> 36:25.733
That little punk...

36:31.584 --> 36:33.947
Wow!

36:38.967 --> 36:41.100
Hey, what did you say?

36:41.100 --> 36:42.767
- Hey...
- What did you say

36:42.767 --> 36:44.733
to make him so pissed?

36:45.367 --> 36:46.867
Tell me.

36:46.867 --> 36:48.800
So I can use it too later.

36:48.800 --> 36:50.633
- Did you see it?
- Yeah, obviously.

36:50.633 --> 36:53.133
His face completely crumpled
after you said that.

36:53.133 --> 36:54.833
No, the culprit!

36:54.833 --> 36:57.833
- Did you see him or not?
- Ah, it hurts.

36:57.833 --> 37:00.300
I'm still a patient.

37:02.067 --> 37:04.167
I got stabbed, remember?

37:05.200 --> 37:07.833
Did you see him or not?

37:07.833 --> 37:09.733
I didn't.

37:14.500 --> 37:15.933
What?

37:15.933 --> 37:20.667
Were you expecting some other name from me?

37:20.667 --> 37:22.767
Are you still not convinced?

37:22.767 --> 37:24.833
That Lee Ki Beom is the killer?

37:28.367 --> 37:29.600
You've been like this from the start.

37:29.600 --> 37:30.867
Ever since

37:30.867 --> 37:34.100
you labeled Lee Ki Beom
as a witness rather than a suspect.

37:34.100 --> 37:36.167
You're excessively favorable toward him.

37:36.167 --> 37:39.400
- It's not that.
- Then what is it?

37:39.400 --> 37:42.367
If Lee Ki Beom is the culprit
in the attack on you,

37:42.367 --> 37:44.867
there's an unexplained gap
in his movements that day.

37:44.867 --> 37:48.300
It really feels like two separate people
were in the same place that day.

37:48.300 --> 37:52.767
Ki Beom is one, and the person who kidnapped
Sun Young and attacked you is another.

37:53.833 --> 37:56.167
- But...
- But what?

37:59.800 --> 38:04.033
Lee Ki Beom was spotted
near victim Lee Joo Hee's house.

38:04.033 --> 38:06.633
Right after the estimated time of the crime.

38:11.100 --> 38:12.967
I was wrong.

38:15.633 --> 38:18.667
The evidence confirms
Lee Ki Beom is the killer.

38:24.400 --> 38:26.867
Thanks for saving Sun Young.

38:27.533 --> 38:31.100
I haven't told her yet
because she's still disoriented.

38:31.100 --> 38:32.733
I'm sorry...

38:40.900 --> 38:42.500
to you,

38:43.367 --> 38:45.667
and to Ms. Sun Young.

38:45.667 --> 38:47.567
I said I'm sorry.

39:38.533 --> 39:40.367
Sun Young, what's wrong?

39:42.433 --> 39:45.767
Did you have a nightmare?

39:45.767 --> 39:47.833
Oh, just a dream?

39:48.733 --> 39:50.867
Is it because you're worried about Ki Beom?

39:50.867 --> 39:54.333
Ji Won, something feels off.

39:54.333 --> 39:59.567
He left like that,
but he hasn't contacted me once.

39:59.567 --> 40:01.633
That's unlike Ki Beom.

40:02.867 --> 40:05.600
Honestly, that's been bothering me too.

40:07.600 --> 40:09.300
I'll check at Ki Hwan's place.

40:09.300 --> 40:12.533
He might have contacted home.

40:12.533 --> 40:14.133
Let's go together.

40:16.467 --> 40:19.633
Yeah, alright, let's go together.

40:23.667 --> 40:26.167
Well... hello?

40:26.167 --> 40:28.233
- Oh!
- Is Seok Man home?

40:28.233 --> 40:30.900
Seok Man's out right now.

40:30.900 --> 40:34.100
By any chance,
has my younger brother been here?

40:34.100 --> 40:36.833
No, he hasn't even shown his face lately.

40:36.833 --> 40:38.500
Tell Ki Beom to come visit.

40:38.500 --> 40:40.200
My daughters are looking for him.

40:40.200 --> 40:43.800
They're asking when the handsome guy
is coming. They're going crazy.

40:44.567 --> 40:46.200
Okay.

41:00.933 --> 41:03.000
Aren't you getting off here?

41:03.000 --> 41:04.233
I'm... I'm sorry.

41:04.233 --> 41:06.133
Oh, for heaven's sake.

41:19.033 --> 41:20.933
Where do you think you're going, you punk?

41:20.933 --> 41:23.433
Oh, you punk... seriously.

41:24.333 --> 41:27.067
Hey, hey!

41:28.067 --> 41:29.700
Get up!

41:30.656 --> 41:32.933
- Darn it!
- Ki Beom!

41:32.933 --> 41:36.100
This punk has no fear.

41:36.100 --> 41:38.133
Hey, go ahead first.

41:38.133 --> 41:40.767
How dare you run! Are you out of your mind?

41:43.072 --> 41:44.928
You punk.

41:47.136 --> 41:48.480
Darn it.

41:53.767 --> 41:55.667
So you know that punk, huh?

42:04.167 --> 42:08.768
Don't say a word about what you just saw.

42:10.800 --> 42:12.600
Unless you want to die.

42:44.300 --> 42:45.933
Hey, you punk!

42:45.933 --> 42:48.704
Speak, you punk!

42:48.704 --> 42:51.191
I said say it.

42:53.856 --> 42:55.327
Say it, you punk!

42:56.288 --> 42:58.433
Spit it out, you punk!

42:58.433 --> 43:01.000
You stubborn punk!

43:02.867 --> 43:05.700
Hey, spit it out!

43:05.700 --> 43:07.900
You killed them all, didn't you?

43:08.800 --> 43:10.667
You punk!

43:12.600 --> 43:17.000
This guy is seriously getting on my nerves.

43:17.000 --> 43:20.800
Hey, haven't I seen you somewhere?

43:22.133 --> 43:24.567
You punk, seriously...

43:26.800 --> 43:29.867
Hey, go easy on him.

43:31.200 --> 43:35.000
Don't worry. I didn't touch his face.

43:35.000 --> 43:36.333
He still won't say where the handkerchief is?

43:36.333 --> 43:39.067
He just keeps saying he lost it.

43:39.067 --> 43:41.267
We got the search warrant.

43:41.267 --> 43:42.900
Really?

43:46.304 --> 43:48.867
Oh, how touching!

43:48.867 --> 43:52.267
Did you come to pick me up
because I'm getting discharged?

43:52.267 --> 43:54.700
Sign this.

43:54.700 --> 43:56.300
What is this?

44:00.367 --> 44:02.800
A search warrant?

44:02.800 --> 44:04.933
I need to catch the culprit.

44:04.933 --> 44:05.967
As soon as possible.

44:05.967 --> 44:07.833
How soon?

44:07.833 --> 44:10.233
Before the new task force is set up.

44:10.233 --> 44:13.600
Before your brother gets to put everything
he's prepared into motion.

44:13.600 --> 44:16.667
Hey, I like that.

44:16.667 --> 44:18.933
I like that a lot.

44:21.200 --> 44:24.167
Looks like Kang Tae Joo
got it approved. Darn it.

44:24.167 --> 44:26.333
When we suggested it, he ignored us.

44:26.333 --> 44:29.067
As long as we got it, it's fine.

44:29.067 --> 44:30.667
What should we do?

44:32.833 --> 44:35.400
Alright, let's go!

44:36.333 --> 44:38.067
Hey!

44:40.533 --> 44:42.633
Speak, you punk!

44:46.533 --> 44:48.133
Ma'am.

44:53.333 --> 44:55.867
Sun Young, what brings you here?

44:55.867 --> 44:58.000
I came to ask if there's been
any contact from Ki Beom.

44:58.000 --> 45:00.333
Why do you care about that?

45:00.333 --> 45:02.733
Didn't you say you were done with Ki Beom?

45:02.733 --> 45:04.600
Ma'am, this is important.

45:04.600 --> 45:06.333
Where is Ki Beom now?

45:06.333 --> 45:08.867
In Haenam. He's at a friend's place.

45:08.867 --> 45:10.633
Really? Are you sure?

45:10.633 --> 45:13.433
He called and said he was doing fine.

45:13.433 --> 45:15.267
Isn't that right?

45:16.733 --> 45:19.500
Jeong Sook,
did you really get a call from him?

45:20.633 --> 45:22.767
Well, actually...

45:25.900 --> 45:29.200
Wow, the weather's really rough today.

45:29.200 --> 45:30.867
Alright, line up.

45:32.767 --> 45:35.367
If you find anything suspicious
during the search,

45:35.367 --> 45:37.367
seize it immediately. Got it?

45:37.367 --> 45:39.167
- Yes, sir!
- Okay.

45:39.167 --> 45:41.267
Excuse me, what's going on here?

45:41.267 --> 45:44.400
What? Is that really true?

45:44.400 --> 45:48.867
So you haven't heard
from Ki Beom at all? Not even once?

45:48.867 --> 45:51.700
Why are you only saying this now?

45:51.700 --> 45:55.467
Ki Hwan told me not to tell you,
afraid it would only worry you.

45:56.467 --> 45:59.367
- Let's go inside.
- What are you doing right now?

45:59.367 --> 46:02.624
Darn it. An insect.

46:05.567 --> 46:07.300
Honey!

46:07.300 --> 46:08.300
Ki Hwan!

46:08.300 --> 46:10.133
Mr. Jang, what are you doing?

46:10.133 --> 46:11.633
Ms. Seo, you're here too.

46:11.633 --> 46:12.733
Are you Lee Ki Beom's mother?

46:12.733 --> 46:16.567
- Yes.
- This is a search warrant for Lee Ki Beom.

46:16.567 --> 46:18.533
We ask for your cooperation.

46:18.533 --> 46:20.600
- Search everything thoroughly! Every corner!
- Yes, sir!

46:20.600 --> 46:22.500
No, wait...

46:22.500 --> 46:25.312
Oh, my. Why are you doing this?

46:29.120 --> 46:32.167
- Mother.
- Why are you doing this?

46:32.167 --> 46:35.467
- Search it thoroughly!
- What are you doing?

46:35.467 --> 46:38.700
What are we going to do?

46:38.700 --> 46:41.333
Where should we start?

46:41.333 --> 46:42.900
[Kangseng Bookstore]

46:42.900 --> 46:45.567
Hey, don't miss a single spot.
Search everything!

46:45.567 --> 46:47.200
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

46:51.578 --> 46:53.658
[Please claim your lost items]

47:00.733 --> 47:02.333
[Capital]

47:02.333 --> 47:05.733
So he's even been acting
like a darn communist...

47:05.733 --> 47:06.867
Wait...

47:06.867 --> 47:09.600
Stop right there, you punk!

47:15.100 --> 47:17.833
Got you, you little rat!

47:17.833 --> 47:21.786
[Please claim your lost items]

47:30.000 --> 47:32.100
Just leave it to other detectives.

47:32.100 --> 47:34.767
You don't have to personally get involved.

47:35.840 --> 47:37.833
Hey, you punk!

47:40.567 --> 47:42.200
Jeez, your stubbornness...

47:42.200 --> 47:43.733
Shouldn't you at least tell us
why you're doing this?

47:43.733 --> 47:46.367
Move aside, unless you want to
be hauled in for obstructing justice.

47:46.367 --> 47:48.733
What exactly did my brother do wrong?

47:48.733 --> 47:51.267
What's with all the questions?

47:51.267 --> 47:55.033
Your brother Lee Ki Beom
is a serial murder suspect.

47:55.700 --> 47:58.500
What did you just say?

47:58.500 --> 48:00.133
Serial murder?

48:00.133 --> 48:04.167
That's ridiculous. Even a passing dog
would laugh at that!

48:04.800 --> 48:06.867
- Tae Joo!
- Detective Kang, what took you so long?

48:06.867 --> 48:08.633
- Tae Joo!
- Prosecutor Cha!

48:08.633 --> 48:11.200
Tae Joo, perfect timing!

48:11.200 --> 48:13.500
These punks are completely delusional.

48:13.500 --> 48:17.300
They're calling our Ki Beom a serial killer.

48:17.300 --> 48:21.733
My boy couldn't even hurt a fly.
How could he kill anyone?

48:21.733 --> 48:24.933
Tae Joo, get through to these idiots.

48:24.933 --> 48:27.700
First, calm the mother down.

48:29.267 --> 48:32.033
Ki Beom really is a serial murder suspect.

48:32.033 --> 48:34.100
He is currently on the run.

48:34.100 --> 48:36.500
Have you had any contact with him?

48:36.500 --> 48:38.933
We must find Ki Beom, ma'am.

48:41.733 --> 48:44.733
You think Ki Beom's a suspect too?

48:46.567 --> 48:48.967
Hey, answer me!

48:48.967 --> 48:53.033
I said, do you doubt him too?

48:54.367 --> 48:56.000
- Yes.
- What?

49:01.733 --> 49:04.433
We have grounds for suspicion,
so we have to investigate.

49:04.433 --> 49:06.967
If Ki Beom's been framed, I'll prove it.

49:06.967 --> 49:10.033
And if he's the real culprit,
I'll make sure he's caught.

49:10.033 --> 49:12.567
So if you trust Ki Beom,

49:12.567 --> 49:15.133
trust me and cooperate
with the investigation.

49:16.067 --> 49:18.100
This is the suspect's room.
Start the search here.

49:18.100 --> 49:19.100
You...

49:19.100 --> 49:20.400
You little punk, I'll...

49:20.400 --> 49:22.367
Mother, Mother!

49:22.367 --> 49:23.400
- Let go!
- Please calm down.

49:23.400 --> 49:26.167
Won't you let go? Let go of me!

49:29.333 --> 49:31.333
This is all your fault!

49:31.333 --> 49:34.633
If you, as the eldest,
had chosen your friends wisely,

49:34.633 --> 49:36.800
would this have happened?

49:36.800 --> 49:37.800
Please stop, ma'am.

49:37.800 --> 49:40.300
Don't touch me.

49:40.300 --> 49:44.333
I was the one who fed you and your sister

49:44.333 --> 49:47.200
when your own mother didn't!

49:47.200 --> 49:48.900
And now you, of all people...

49:48.900 --> 49:52.433
are trying to destroy my son?

49:53.267 --> 49:56.767
- Mother!
- Mother!

49:56.767 --> 49:58.800
- Mother!
- Mother!

49:58.800 --> 50:00.067
Mother, are you okay?

50:00.067 --> 50:01.233
Mother!

50:01.233 --> 50:03.267
Take your hand off me.

50:33.200 --> 50:34.800
Sun Young, you...

50:35.900 --> 50:37.733
Don't tell me it's his...

50:39.100 --> 50:41.088
It's Ki Beom's child.

50:41.088 --> 50:42.633
Jeez.

50:42.633 --> 50:43.867
You... seriously?

50:43.867 --> 50:45.867
Have you lost your mind?

50:45.867 --> 50:47.567
That guy is a serial killer!

50:47.567 --> 50:48.567
How could you carry his child?

50:48.567 --> 50:50.233
Don't say that!

50:50.233 --> 50:52.033
Ki Beom's not a serial killer.

50:52.033 --> 50:53.633
I remembered what happened that day.

50:53.633 --> 50:57.167
I clearly remember the person
who dragged me away from behind.

50:57.167 --> 51:00.367
- It wasn't Ki Beom.
- Don't talk nonsense!

51:00.367 --> 51:02.833
There weren't any streetlights
in those fields where you were taken!

51:02.833 --> 51:04.500
You couldn't see anything!

51:04.500 --> 51:08.333
He was limping, like he was injured.
I swear it's true!

51:08.333 --> 51:09.933
Enough!

51:13.200 --> 51:15.433
Even if you're telling the truth,
I can't believe you.

51:15.433 --> 51:19.333
You'd even twist your own memories
to protect Ki Beom.

51:21.433 --> 51:23.400
- Tae Joo.
- Sun Young.

51:23.400 --> 51:24.667
Go wait in my car.

51:24.667 --> 51:26.033
Ji Won, but...

51:26.033 --> 51:29.216
Nothing you say will change anything.
Don't waste your energy. Just go.

51:29.216 --> 51:30.656
Go on ahead.

51:31.600 --> 51:33.600
Go.

51:33.600 --> 51:35.233
Go on ahead.

51:39.900 --> 51:42.200
Are you seriously not going to
investigate this properly?

51:44.300 --> 51:48.033
I'm doing this now because I'm trying
to investigate properly.

51:48.033 --> 51:50.967
If I hadn't trusted that punk and hesitated,

51:50.967 --> 51:52.400
it never would've come to this.

51:52.400 --> 51:54.100
Give me a break.

51:54.100 --> 51:56.300
Hey, don't fool yourself.

51:56.300 --> 51:58.900
You're not some warm-hearted guy.

51:58.900 --> 52:02.067
You acted that way simply
because there wasn't enough evidence.

52:02.067 --> 52:05.433
Because things didn't add up.
There were gaps you couldn't explain.

52:05.433 --> 52:09.200
That's just who you are, Kang Tae Joo!

52:21.600 --> 52:23.520
Jeez.

52:34.067 --> 52:36.300
- Huh?
- What is that?

52:36.300 --> 52:37.900
This...

52:39.833 --> 52:41.433
This punk.

52:42.500 --> 52:44.133
Look at this.

52:47.800 --> 52:49.400
Detective Kang!

52:50.333 --> 52:53.833
I knew you had some connection
with Lee Ki Beom,

52:53.833 --> 52:56.633
but I didn't realize you were this close.

53:01.376 --> 53:03.328
[Wedding Reception]

53:06.533 --> 53:08.533
Hey, it's been a while.

53:08.533 --> 53:10.500
You're late, Tae Joo.

53:10.500 --> 53:12.767
I had something to deal with,
so I left Seoul late.

53:12.767 --> 53:13.767
Where is the groom?

53:13.767 --> 53:14.967
He went to the restroom.

53:14.967 --> 53:16.267
I think he's got an upset stomach.

53:16.267 --> 53:18.333
He must've eaten everything they gave him.

53:18.333 --> 53:19.333
No wonder.

53:19.333 --> 53:21.000
- Hello!
- Hello!

53:21.000 --> 53:22.900
It's been a while.

53:22.900 --> 53:26.833
Everyone else is getting married.
When are you going to?

53:26.833 --> 53:28.533
Do you at least have a girlfriend?

53:28.533 --> 53:30.900
- Well, that's...
- Tae Joo!

53:30.900 --> 53:32.333
Why are you so late?

53:32.333 --> 53:34.633
The wedding's already over.

53:34.633 --> 53:37.133
I came all this way,
so you should at least thank me.

53:37.133 --> 53:38.800
You punk...

53:38.800 --> 53:39.933
Here, this is for the wedding.

53:39.933 --> 53:41.733
Thank you!

53:41.733 --> 53:44.867
Tae Joo, let's take a picture together.
We should at least have one.

53:44.867 --> 53:46.633
I'm dressed like this.
How am I supposed to take a picture?

53:46.633 --> 53:47.800
I'll take a picture of you two.

53:47.800 --> 53:49.833
Ki Beom, you should take one with us.

53:49.833 --> 53:51.867
Yong Tae, take a picture of us here.

53:51.867 --> 53:53.800
Alright.

53:53.800 --> 53:55.400
Just one shot, please.

54:01.333 --> 54:02.900
Okay, look here.

54:02.900 --> 54:05.767
One, two, three!

54:11.200 --> 54:14.533
December 13, 1987.

54:16.067 --> 54:20.367
If you were this close, shouldn't you
have recused yourself from the investigation?

54:22.733 --> 54:24.433
Hey, Kang Tae Joo!

54:26.433 --> 54:28.800
That punk...

54:28.800 --> 54:30.867
He's running now that it's not in his favor.

54:44.600 --> 54:46.733
Choi In Sook, Choi In Sook...

54:52.433 --> 54:56.933
[Choi In Sook's Records]
Choi In Sook, missing on December 13, 1987.

54:56.933 --> 55:00.900
Estimated time of the crime, 8:30 PM.

55:11.367 --> 55:13.733
Ki Beom was with me at that time.

55:15.233 --> 55:17.367
How did this happen?

55:17.367 --> 55:20.100
Who would've thought it would turn up there?

55:20.100 --> 55:21.733
- Right.
- Oh, Kang Tae Joo!

55:21.733 --> 55:23.067
You are already here?

55:23.067 --> 55:26.267
Sir, we found evidence
that Lee Ki Beom is the culprit.

55:26.267 --> 55:27.500
What?

55:27.500 --> 55:29.100
Here.

55:32.500 --> 55:34.100
What is this?

55:35.767 --> 55:38.667
[Please claim your lost items]

55:48.300 --> 55:49.900
Inside this,

55:50.733 --> 55:52.333
[Park Ae Sook]
we found this.

55:58.633 --> 56:00.200
This belongs to Park Ae Sook's?

56:00.200 --> 56:01.867
Yes.

56:01.867 --> 56:04.867
We just came back after confirming it
directly with Park Ae Sook.

56:04.867 --> 56:07.467
She said she lost it on the day of the crime.

56:07.467 --> 56:10.367
[Resident Registration Card, Park Ae Sook]

56:11.333 --> 56:14.533
Where could the prosecutor be?

56:14.533 --> 56:17.600
[Capital 1-1, Capital 1-2]
Maybe at the office?

56:17.600 --> 56:20.300
Got him, got him!

56:20.300 --> 56:21.600
I'll go report and come back.

56:21.600 --> 56:23.233
Yes, sir.

56:30.267 --> 56:32.967
Park Ae Sook's handbag
found in the bookstore.

56:32.967 --> 56:36.267
That's evidence that Ki Beom is the culprit.

56:36.267 --> 56:40.600
But the photo found at the house
proves Ki Beom has an alibi.

56:40.600 --> 56:44.033
Two pieces of evidence are telling
completely opposite truths.

56:45.200 --> 56:47.233
What is this?

56:47.233 --> 56:49.667
What am I missing here?

56:51.633 --> 56:53.900
Tae Joo!

56:55.167 --> 56:57.233
What did you mean earlier?

56:57.233 --> 57:00.333
Why did you say our Ki Beom is a murderer?

57:00.333 --> 57:01.967
Ki Hwan, let's talk later.

57:01.967 --> 57:03.600
Hey!

57:05.367 --> 57:08.300
When did you start suspecting Ki Beom?

57:09.467 --> 57:11.400
Don't tell me it was from
when you came to my house?

57:11.400 --> 57:13.900
The settlement was just an excuse,

57:13.900 --> 57:15.967
and you came to find our Ki Beom?

57:15.967 --> 57:17.633
Is that it?

57:19.733 --> 57:20.867
Answer me, you punk!

57:20.867 --> 57:22.833
How could I not suspect him?

57:23.467 --> 57:25.033
What?

57:25.033 --> 57:27.800
A victim's belonging
was found at the bookstore,

57:27.800 --> 57:31.300
and the last places victims Yu Jeong Rin
and Kim Min Ji visited were your bookstore.

57:31.300 --> 57:33.700
And the suspect was wearing
Ki Beom's handkerchief!

57:34.767 --> 57:37.667
So how could I not suspect Ki Beom?

57:37.667 --> 57:40.933
What came out of the bookstore?

57:42.933 --> 57:45.400
Ki Hwan, this is...

57:45.400 --> 57:48.567
It doesn't make sense
unless Ki Beom is the real culprit.

57:48.567 --> 57:50.633
If not Ki Beom, then who...

57:55.133 --> 58:00.767
Someone besides Ki Beom who can enter
both the bookstore and the house.

58:02.333 --> 58:03.967
There is...

58:05.600 --> 58:07.567
another suspect.

58:19.467 --> 58:22.900
Mr. Lee Yong Woo, have you been well?

58:23.667 --> 58:25.533
Where is he?

58:25.533 --> 58:28.733
Professor Kang Tae Joo
has returned to his main job.

58:28.733 --> 58:32.000
He needs to finish his research paper too.

58:32.000 --> 58:37.167
Are you saying that meeting me
is less important than his paper?

58:37.167 --> 58:39.233
It's not like that.

58:44.733 --> 58:48.000
Lee Yong Woo has clammed up again.

58:48.733 --> 58:51.933
He's gone back to how he was
when we first met.

58:52.600 --> 58:56.600
He's not only hostile,
but he's also being really spiteful.

58:57.400 --> 59:01.300
Why did you quit, anyway?

59:01.300 --> 59:04.500
You really built a good rapport
with Lee Yong Woo.

59:04.500 --> 59:07.200
Now, that kind of thing
should be handled by active-duty officers.

59:07.200 --> 59:10.167
Don't think about using an old man like me.

59:10.167 --> 59:12.767
Please tell me how to do it, sir.

59:12.767 --> 59:15.700
How to make Lee Yong Woo talk?

59:19.433 --> 59:23.267
Lee Yong Woo has already made up his mind.

59:23.267 --> 59:25.500
He's decided to tell the truth.

59:26.200 --> 59:28.533
So it won't be difficult.

59:33.467 --> 59:35.800
Oh, and...

59:35.800 --> 59:39.267
Lee Yong Woo asked me
to pass this to you, sir.

59:40.667 --> 59:43.400
He said it was a gift or something.

59:43.400 --> 59:45.033
A gift?

59:46.333 --> 59:50.333
[Murder: 12+2, Rape: 19, Attempted: 15]

59:52.533 --> 59:54.033
What is this?

59:54.033 --> 59:55.333
What are these numbers?

59:55.333 --> 59:57.467
[Murder: 12+2, Rape: 19, Attempted: 15]

01:00:01.600 --> 01:00:03.267
The truth.

01:00:36.400 --> 01:00:39.433
The suspect is a Mr. Lee
residing in Kangseng...

01:00:39.433 --> 01:00:41.533
Lee Ki Beom has just
made his first confession.

01:00:41.533 --> 01:00:43.500
Ki Beom, is it really you?

01:00:43.500 --> 01:00:44.567
Answer me!

01:00:44.567 --> 01:00:45.667
Was it really you?

01:00:45.667 --> 01:00:47.667
So that's why you tried
to kill Sun Young too?

01:00:47.667 --> 01:00:50.100
But she's not my family.

01:00:52.100 --> 01:00:55.667
Are you the real culprit
in the serial murder case?

01:00:55.667 --> 01:00:57.167
Is this actually Lee Ki Beom's statement?

01:00:57.167 --> 01:00:58.400
It's all just things we already know.

01:00:58.400 --> 01:00:59.600
And some of it is completely wrong.

01:00:59.600 --> 01:01:00.900
Unlawful confinement and assault!

01:01:00.900 --> 01:01:03.500
If Prosecutor Cha finds out
everything you've done...
